{"4293810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chance", "steam_appid": 4293810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chance is a property-trading board game inspired by The Landlord's Game. Buy property, build improvements, raise your rents and draw Chance cards. Bankrupt your opponents to win the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player strategy game with elements of deck-building. Different building types have different effects on what you earn. Carefully choose combinations to maximise your income and drain the other players' bank accounts. Collect Chance cards to modify the rules and tip the balance in your favour.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 building types to squeeze the pips from your unlucky tenants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different dice types so you can always be sure of the perfect roll</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 chance cards to bend the rules in your favour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 properties to add to your portfolio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Railroads, utilities and even the necessities of life can be bought</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chance is a property-trading board game inspired by The Landlord's Game. Buy property, build improvements, raise your rents and draw Chance cards. Bankrupt your opponents to win the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player strategy game with elements of deck-building. Different building types have different effects on what you earn. Carefully choose combinations to maximise your income and drain the other players' bank accounts. Collect Chance cards to modify the rules and tip the balance in your favour.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 building types to squeeze the pips from your unlucky tenants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different dice types so you can always be sure of the perfect roll</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 chance cards to bend the rules in your favour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 properties to add to your portfolio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Railroads, utilities and even the necessities of life can be bought</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The property-trading deckbuilder. Chance is strange, dusty board game where you steal land from the bourgeoisie, bankrupt the proletariat, break the rules with unfair chance cards, and discover strategies worthy of an antitrust lawsuit.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4293810/d62672f6f990c39ce8b21564d2696c40033f70f8/header.jpg?t=1782760567", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4293810/e95acb7f4cf55500c4db017eb4e61adde71458ff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782760567", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4293810/e95acb7f4cf55500c4db017eb4e61adde71458ff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782760567", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> None</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> None</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> None</li></ul>", "recommended": "<stron